<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00793">
	<title>Remote Smart Parking button</title>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc" pgwide="true" rowsep="1">
			<tgroup cols="3" colsep="1" outputclass="formatc" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="newCol3" colnum="3" colwidth="50*"/>
				<thead>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<p>Parking/View button</p>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2">
							<p>Smart key</p>
						</entry>
						<entry>
							<p>Digital key</p>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</thead>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="0">
						<entry align="center" valign="middle">
							<fig id="e02542">
								<figgroup>
									<image href="../../images/N_CT25E132_1.eps" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry align="center" valign="middle">
							<fig id="e02543">
								<figgroup>
									<image href="../../images/N_CT25E122.eps" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry>
							<fig id="e02544">
								<figgroup>
									<image href="../../images/N_TK25E009_E.eps" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc" pgwide="true" rowsep="1">
			<tgroup cols="4" colsep="1" outputclass="formatc" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="14*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="17*"/>
				<colspec colname="col3" colnum="3" colwidth="10*"/>
				<colspec colname="col4" colnum="4" colwidth="59*"/>
				<thead>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<p>Location</p>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2">
							<p>Name</p>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col3">
							<p>Symbol</p>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col4">
							<p>Description</p>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</thead>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry align="center" valign="middle">
							<p>Inside vehicle</p>
						</entry>
						<entry align="center" colname="col2" valign="middle">
							<p>Parking/View button</p>
						</entry>
						<entry align="center" colname="col3" valign="middle">
							<p> <image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_106.eps" scale="15" placement="inline"/> </p>
						</entry>
						<entry align="left" colname="col4">
							<ul>
								<li>
									<p>Press and hold the Parking/View button to turn on Remote Smart Parking Assist. Also, Parking Distance Warning will automatically turn on.</p>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</entry>
					</row>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry align="center" valign="middle" morerows="2">
							<p>Smart key</p>
						</entry>
						<entry align="center" colname="col2" valign="middle">
							<p>Remote Start button</p>
						</entry>
						<entry align="center" colname="col3" valign="middle">
							<p> <image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_108.eps" scale="15" placement="inline"/> </p>
						</entry>
						<entry align="left" colname="col4">
							<ul>
								<li>
									<p>Press the Remote Start button after the door is locked with the vehicle off to start the vehicle remotely.</p>
								</li>
								<li>
									<p>Press the Remote Start button while Remote Operation function is operating to end function operation.</p>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</entry>
					</row>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry align="center" colname="col2" valign="middle">
							<p>Forward button</p>
						</entry>
						<entry align="center" colname="col3" valign="middle">
							<p> <image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_109.eps" scale="15" placement="inline"/> </p>
						</entry>
						<entry align="left" valign="middle" morerows="1">
							<p>When using Remote Smart Parking function, regardless of which direction button is pressed, reverse parking is supported while the button is pressed.</p>
						</entry>
					</row>
					<row rowsep="0">
						<entry align="center" colname="col2" valign="middle">
							<p>Backward button</p>
						</entry>
						<entry align="center" colname="col3" valign="middle">
							<p> <image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_110.eps" scale="15" placement="inline"/> </p>
						</entry>
					</row>
					<row>
						<entry align="center" valign="middle">
							<p>Digital key</p>
						</entry>
						<entry align="center" colname="col2" valign="middle">
							<p>Remote Smart Parking button</p>
						</entry>
						<entry align="center" colname="col3" valign="middle">
							<p> <image href="../../images/N_TK25E162.eps" scale="15" align="center" placement="inline"/> </p>
						</entry>
						<entry align="left">
							<ul id="e02545">
								<li>
									<p>When using Remote Forward/Backward, swipe the vehicle icon to move the vehicle in the desired direction</p>
								</li>
								<li>
									<p>When using Remote Smart Parking Assist, press and hold the icon to operate the function.</p>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<note type="warning" id="e02546">
			<p>Always check the surroundings while operating the button.</p>
		</note>
		<note type="note" id="e02547">
			<p>Digital Key may not be available depending on the regulations of each country.</p>
		</note>
	</conbody>
</concept>